        <item>
            <title>Version 2.1.12</title>
            <description>
                <![CDATA[
                <h1 id="v2112">v2.1.12</h1>

<h3 id="features">🚀 Features</h3>

<ul>
  <li>File Compare: refresh folder view when file reloads after external change (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/20209acd2cfb281403a6e81210efad0c96cfce8e">20209ac</a>)</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="bug-fixes">🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>

<ul>
  <li>
    <p>change OSD icon contrast (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/fda5c429c64877c1f3524c47a39cf5745dd6733d">fda5c42</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>make regex ranges unicode-safe (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/9e30e8b6710973bfabc8ab435248304dbff031ac">9e30e8b</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>resolve crash on invalid predicates (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/95f0ff6d89d13ce40daece3b880ba5c333f61b90">95f0ff6</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>resolve crash when called on root item (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/d02b3aeee89588e945cd099d740320aa319306db">d02b3ae</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>resolve crash when group index overflows Int (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/712e5701f1016353b67d79417fb459996c9de4ee">712e570</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>skip invalid tab width (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/0db363d961596f63d83e5abf8c3287f6b47d1e78">0db363d</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>File Compare: move to first difference on slow machines (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/0eb8c73fc7fa1b19b5fe35933c30a741237f82ab">0eb8c73</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>File Compare: show correct OSD when navigating past file boundaries (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/5410793c2dd1b792f887d4f0fe41f9571dd325b0">5410793</a>)</p>
  </li>
</ul>


                ]]>
